# Review regression (stale result, pocket hold). Before: a memo saved while locked, then 10
# minutes later the habitual hold from the dark: the instant G0 went up the card flipped to
# the 10-minute-old "√ 已存 0:02" with Mando's 存好了, which on a silent device reads "my memo
# was saved"; and a G0 held in a pocket kept the backlight fully on for as long as it stayed down.
# Now: 没有在录 / 松开，点一下再按住 with Mando awake until the card goes dark, the old result gone
# with the hold (a tap shows the clock); a held G0 lights the card 10 s past its time at most.
boot store=sd usb=off bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+l
wait 3000
press g0
wait 800
down g0
wait 600
mic 2000 speech
up g0
wait 900
shot result  a memo from the card: √ 已存 0:02 for 2 s
wait 600000
down g0
wait 2000
shot held  10 min later, the habit: a hold from the dark, 没有在录
up g0
wait 300
shot released  released: still 没有在录, Mando awake (never the old √ 已存 / 存好了)
wait 1500
shot dark  the card went dark
press g0
wait 400
shot tapped  the tap the card asked for: the clock, Mando dozing (the old result is gone)
wait 3500
down g0
wait 5000
shot pocket-5s  G0 held 5 s in a pocket: the card lit, 没有在录
wait 10000
shot pocket-15s  15 s: dark (the card stays lit 10 s past its 3 s at most)
up g0
wait 500
shot pocket-up  released: still dark, nothing recorded
